    "message": "Move test_windows_storage_compat.py into the projects and query cursor tests\n\nThe run writer lease is in sheltersim.storage.projects and the scan\ncursor key in sheltersim.storage.query_cursors, so each test joins that\nmodule's file. Both keep the original skip without Linux open-file-\ndescription locks; the Windows simulation becomes the windows_like\nfixture, which imports fcntl only when used. Both destinations already\nexist, so the move is one commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
